.TH TRACE_V3 1 "March 2026" "trace_v3" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
trace_v3 \- file dependency tracer using eBPF
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B trace_v3
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fISUBCOMMAND\fR] -- \fICOMMAND\fR [\fIARGS...\fR]
.br
.B trace_v3
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] attach \fIPID\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBtrace_v3\fR traces file dependencies for a command using eBPF. It attaches
to syscall tracepoints and records which files are read and written. It can
produce summary output at the end of a run and optionally stream events while
the command is running.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB--trace-file\fR \fIPATH\fR
Write per-event trace log to \fIPATH\fR or "-" for stdout (default "-").
.TP
\fB--dep-file\fR \fIPATH\fR
Write summarized dependencies to \fIPATH\fR or "-" for stdout (default "-").
.TP
\fB--missed-file\fR \fIPATH\fR
Write count of missed events to \fIPATH\fR or "-" (default "-").
.TP
\fB--mode\fR \fIsummary|stream|both\fR
Select summary-only (default), streaming-only, or both.
.TP
\fB--stream-read\fR
Enable streaming of read events ("R <path>").
.TP
\fB--stream-write\fR
Enable streaming of write events ("W <path>").
.TP
\fB--stream-trace\fR
Enable streaming of dependency events.
.TP
\fB--stream-read-file\fR \fIPATH\fR
Destination for streamed read events (default "-").
.TP
\fB--stream-write-file\fR \fIPATH\fR
Destination for streamed write events (default "-").
.TP
\fB--stream-trace-file\fR \fIPATH\fR
Destination for streamed dependency events (default "-").
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
\fBinstall\fR
Load and pin the eBPF programs and maps in the kernel. Typically run once
before tracing.
.TP
\fBattach\fR \fIPID\fR
Attach to an already running process instead of forking a new one.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Trace a command and write outputs to files:
.br
\fBtrace_v3 --trace-file out/trace.log --dep-file out/deps.log --missed-file out/missed.txt -- make -j8\fR
.TP
Stream read and write events while also writing summary files:
.br
\fBtrace_v3 --mode both --stream-read --stream-write -- make test\fR
.TP
Attach to an existing process:
.br
\fBtrace_v3 --mode stream attach 12345\fR
.SH FILES
.TP
\fB/sys/fs/bpf/trace_v3\fR
Pinned eBPF programs and maps used by trace_v3.
.SH SEE ALSO
trace_v3 documentation file (DOCUMENTATION.txt)
.SH AUTHOR
trace_v3 contributors


